  "title": "Artist of the Week: Crocodiles",
  "content": "<div class=\"ContentRightInner t_mbgc t_qtc t_urtc\">\n<div id=\"inboxControl0fv-ReadMessageContainer\" class=\"v-ReadMessageContainer slideOnResize\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"c-ReadMessage\" data-link=\"class{readMessageClass: ~tag.Show}\">\n<div id=\"ReadMessageScrollableSection\" class=\"rmMessages ClearBoth\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div id=\"readMessagePartControl247f\" class=\"c-ReadMessagePart ReadMsgContainer HasLayout ClearBoth HideShadows FullPart NoHistory Read RmIc\" data-link=\"class{:~tag.getHeaderCssClass(IsConversationPart, IsRead, IsDraft, IsTrustedSender, Items.length)}\">\n<div class=\"c-ReadMessagePartBody\" data-link=\"class{getClass:IsBodyExpanded}\">\n<div class=\"readMsgBody\">\n<div id=\"bodyreadMessagePartBodyControl252f\" class=\"ExternalClass MsgBodyContainer\" data-link=\"class{:~tag.cssClasses(PlainText, IsContentFiltered)}\">\n<div class=\"v-InboxFooterContainer\">\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><em>12 May 2015</em></p>\n<div id=\"attachment_7802\" style=\"width: 726px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-7802\" class=\"wp-image-7802 size-full\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/2fa158ccd129955ef212d5badd9535b8-e1431412374553.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"716\" height=\"617\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/2fa158ccd129955ef212d5badd9535b8-e1431412374553.jpg 716w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/2fa158ccd129955ef212d5badd9535b8-e1431412374553-300x259.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/2fa158ccd129955ef212d5badd9535b8-e1431412374553-522x450.jpg 522w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 716px) 100vw, 716px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-7802\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Image: Bon Duke</p></div>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\"><b>Who is that?</b></p>\n<div class=\"ContentRightInner t_mbgc t_qtc t_urtc\">\n<div id=\"inboxControl0fv-ReadMessageContainer\" class=\"v-ReadMessageContainer slideOnResize\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"c-ReadMessage\" data-link=\"class{readMessageClass: ~tag.Show}\">\n<div id=\"ReadMessageScrollableSection\" class=\"rmMessages ClearBoth\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div id=\"readMessagePartControl247f\" class=\"c-ReadMessagePart ReadMsgContainer HasLayout ClearBoth HideShadows FullPart NoHistory Read RmIc\" data-link=\"class{:~tag.getHeaderCssClass(IsConversationPart, IsRead, IsDraft, IsTrustedSender, Items.length)}\">\n<div class=\"c-ReadMessagePartBody\" data-link=\"class{getClass:IsBodyExpanded}\">\n<div class=\"readMsgBody\">\n<div id=\"bodyreadMessagePartBodyControl252f\" class=\"ExternalClass MsgBodyContainer\" data-link=\"class{:~tag.cssClasses(PlainText, IsContentFiltered)}\">\n<div class=\"v-InboxFooterContainer\">\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\">Crocodiles are a duo &#8211; Charles Rowell and Brandon Welchez &#8211; who first came to our attention when they supported <a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/dum-dum-girls/\" target=\"_blank\">Dum Dum Girls at Start the Bus</a> last year.</p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\"><b>What’s their sound?</b></p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\">In a similar vein to Dum Dum Girls, Crocodiles are able to create a wall of fuzz with punk sensibilities, but also tend to meander from this through Revolver-era Beatles psychedelia and a Stone Roses stupor. Overall, they rely on a raw sound, highly distorted guitars and sneering vocals.</p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\"><b>What are they up to?</b></p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\">Crocodiles have just released a new album, <em>Boys</em>, which is billed &#8220;for boys and for girls and for boy-girls and mutants, back-alley poets, thieves, space cadets and alien babes, righteous tricksters, sonic deviants, and everything in between.&#8221; Having streamed it in full (have a listen to &#8216;Crybaby Demon&#8217; below), it&#8217;s definitely hard to disagree with this assessment.</p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\"><b>Where can I see them?</b></p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\">Crocodiles are touring North America and Europe, stopping off at Start the Bus on 16 June.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/189298495&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;show_comments=true&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false&amp;visual=true\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"no\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe></p>\n<p><b>Conal Dougan</b></p>\n<p></p>",
